            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The harvesting of wood considers the motor-manual processes for "Buche, II. Ertragsklasse, starke Durchforstung"\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes manual harvesting of the cork (every 10 years) and motor-manual processes for thinning and final cutting of the trees. Also included are the transport of the workers to the forests for harvesting cork and the transport of the products to the nearest forest road.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
